    {"role": "user", "content": "Explain how photosynthesis works."},
    {"role": "assistant", "content": "Plants convert sunlight into chemical energy using chlorophyll. This process combines carbon dioxide and water to produce glucose and oxygen. It happens mainly in the leaves."},
